{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963880/extras/a4a42679cd150c3bd1b0100422936adb.poster.avif?t=1758059234\" width=1170 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963880/extras/a4a42679cd150c3bd1b0100422936adb.webm?t=1758059234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963880/extras/a4a42679cd150c3bd1b0100422936adb.mp4?t=1758059234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>SURROUNDED</i> is a <strong>1\u20134 player online co-op survival horror</strong> experience where every mission feels different. You and your team are sent into a hostile wilderness zone. The objective is simple: <strong>explore, survive, and escape alive.</strong> But you are never truly alone\u2014the environments are crawling with unpredictable entities that stalk, react, and strike when you least expect it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963880/extras/9512c2200ddcbd864764f73ebaa76529.poster.avif?t=1758059234\" width=1170 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963880/extras/9512c2200ddcbd864764f73ebaa76529.webm?t=1758059234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963880/extras/9512c2200ddcbd864764f73ebaa76529.mp4?t=1758059234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work as a team to <strong>outsmart the threats</strong>. Communicate, share resources, and plan your routes\u2014or watch your squad crumble as panic sets in. Lone players face <i>an almost impossible challenge</i>, but the bravest may still attempt it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963880/extras/25f42e1ab99bad536aafdd0cfba2a0aa.poster.avif?t=1758059234\" width=1170 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963880/extras/25f42e1ab99bad536aafdd0cfba2a0aa.webm?t=1758059234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963880/extras/25f42e1ab99bad536aafdd0cfba2a0aa.mp4?t=1758059234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two encounters are the same. Entities use <strong>advanced AI</strong> to stalk, ambush, and surprise you in unique ways. Sometimes you\u2019ll hear them before you see them. Other times\u2026 it\u2019s already too late.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963880/extras/99cf6dc7a4a93b14d43787a46bace934.poster.avif?t=1758059234\" width=1170 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963880/extras/99cf6dc7a4a93b14d43787a46bace934.webm?t=1758059234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963880/extras/99cf6dc7a4a93b14d43787a46bace934.mp4?t=1758059234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural elements, randomized objectives, and shifting enemy behavior ensure <strong>endless replayability</strong>. Every run demands new strategies and quick thinking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963880/extras/28dcbbbe459a11a283eb29abd9ce4010.poster.avif?t=1758059234\" width=1170 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963880/extras/28dcbbbe459a11a283eb29abd9ce4010.webm?t=1758059234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963880/extras/28dcbbbe459a11a283eb29abd9ce4010.mp4?t=1758059234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every location is designed to pull you into the horror. Darkness, atmosphere, and sound work against you\u2014heightening tension with every step.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963880/extras/dc61b948a63b84236310e20d8782a601.poster.avif?t=1758059234\" width=1170 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963880/extras/dc61b948a63b84236310e20d8782a601.webm?t=1758059234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963880/extras/dc61b948a63b84236310e20d8782a601.mp4?t=1758059234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1\u20134 Player Online Co-op</strong> \u2013 Play solo or with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Enemy AI</strong> \u2013 Each entity behaves differently every encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression System</strong> \u2013 Unlock achievements, lore, and rewards for surviving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Replay Value</strong> \u2013 Randomized maps, objectives, and encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True Ending</strong> \u2013 Persistent survivors may uncover the game\u2019s hidden truth.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>How long can you last when you\u2019re SURROUNDED?</strong></i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3963880?t=1758059234","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963880/5931b55728fabfd563acbaa5215f9c3eb88a66b1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758059234","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963880/a5676de28c4665848683357def6258f461e0a835/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758059234","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963880/a5676de28c4665848683357def6258f461e0a835/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758059234","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"SURROUNDED contains intense survival horror elements, including jump scares, frightening atmosphere, depictions of blood, and violence from hostile entities. While there is no sexual or satanic content, the game\u2019s tone and visuals are designed to be unsettling and may not be suitable for all audiences."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragr